# Coding standards

- Read `docs/platform/coding-standards.md` before adding or changing C#.
- File-scoped namespaces, nullable enable, `...Async`, constructor injection, readonly `_camelCase`.
- API contracts live in `Journeys.Dto`. No business rules in controllers.
- Do not reformat files you did not change.
